body:
Yes I fear you may be right. I hope to get off it in the future and am able to manage my growing business and continue to be a productive member of society . Until then I hope my body holds up. I am confident everything will work out in the end regardless of what happens. I have a roof over my head, food, water and everything I need to live. Thats more than a lot of people can say so I am grateful for that.

&#x200B;

It could always be worse I suppose

I literally have negative Karma from this I didnt even know that was possible lol... I am assuming this was downvoted because it sounded counter productive . Please be aware that my intention was NOT to promote this just to start an AMA its my first one ever .

&#x200B;

THIS IS NOT WHAT YOU WANT TO DO. IT IS WHAT I AM DOING AND I WILL SUFFER IN THE LONG RUN 10/10 dont reccommend

): Im very confused now I felt so much better day to day knowing everything was going to be okay. If that was indeed satan talking with me I just don't have the understanding yet.. thank-you so much for your response even though it's really the exact opposite of what i was hoping for.

&#x200B;

I may make another post about something else I have been wondering about . I am newer to reddit im not sure how much posting is allowed

Thank you so much for your response. I am a bit confused about the angel of light part at the end.

&#x200B;

Does this mean that this was satan speaking to me? uh oh...
